# Model artifacts are DATA, not text.
#
# Every .pkl here carries a binary xgboost booster buffer. autocrlf rewriting a
# stray 0x0A on checkout corrupts it, and the corruption is SILENT until
# something opens the file — which nothing does for a paused model. The root
# .gitattributes already carries this rule for ncaaf_live/data/artifacts and
# has since a rebase crashed the suite; models/saved was never covered.
#
# Patterns in a .gitattributes are relative to ITS OWN directory, so this is
# `*`, not `models/saved/*`.
* -text
